/* 课程（Figma 643:802）：TabHero；“从这一节开始”焦点卡（全页唯一实心按钮，竹简插画）；按主题看；其余课程行。 */
page {
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.course-page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom);
  background: var(--p3-paper);
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

.course-content {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  padding: 8rpx var(--p3-page-x) 56rpx;
}

.course-focus__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.course-focus__copy {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12rpx;
}

.course-focus__kicker {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.course-focus__title {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 40rpx;
  line-height: 56rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.course-focus__art {
  width: 144rpx;
  height: 144rpx;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.course-focus__scene {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.course-focus__meta {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.course-section {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

/* 主题横向滑动：贴到屏幕边缘，左右留页面边距。 */
.course-themes {
  width: calc(100% + 2 * var(--p3-page-x));
  margin: 0 calc(-1 * var(--p3-page-x));
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.course-themes__list {
  display: inline-flex;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  padding: 0 var(--p3-page-x);
}

.course-themes__chip {
  width: auto;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.course-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  padding: 8rpx 36rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

.course-list__item {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 0;
  text-align: left;
}
